Package: vabaxos-games
Architecture: all
Maintainer: VabaxOS <https://github.com/Vabax-dev/VabaxOS>
Section: games
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, pipewire-bin | pulseaudio-utils | alsa-utils
Description: Audio games of VabaxOS, with the keyboard and the voice
 Sound memory (repeat longer and longer sequences of notes with the keys
 1 to 4), guess the number from 1 to 100, and tic-tac-toe against the
 computer with the keys of the number pad. Everything is said by the
 screen reader.
